  "reflectionText": "Ruth went down to the threshing floor at Naomi's word, uncovered the feet of Boaz, and lay down. He woke at midnight and said: who are you? What is the quiet of laying yourself at the feet of a man who must decide whether to redeem you, before the morning comes to undo what the night has begun?"
